Z||000000||GodSend||02-07-2001||12:36 PM||||  Guys, I am trying to run a 4g amp wire to the battery.  I look the center console out (where the sub is going) and wanted to drill a small hole (with gormet) in the upper section of the firewall between the two "wire harness'".  <P>  Is this section single or double firewalled?<P><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.hypernetcommunications.com/revn.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||jch82||02-07-2001||12:39 PM||||Me and my buddy drilled a hole a couple inches above the ECM for his power wire. It worked out fine.<P>------------------<BR>Before you criticize someone, walk a mile in his shoes. That way, if he  gets angry, he'll be a mile way - and barefoot....||||reg||1
