Z||000003||Black88GT||02-07-2001||03:48 PM||||In my old Fiero I did the same thing jch82 did.  Worked out well, but I don't think I am going to put an amp in the trunk again.  It was a pain in the butt to wire it and it gets pretty hot in the trunk.  I think I will stick it behind the drivers seat this spring when I do the install....<P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>'88 GT t-top 3.4<BR>Baltimore, MD<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/cartmanico.gif">             <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/kennyico.gif">           <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/stanico.gif">         <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/kyleico.gif">             <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/chefico.gif"> ||||reg||1
